1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,950
Do you suffer from AppSheet?

2
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:18,950
Do you open two apps to report one day?

3
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:24,750
Do you press buttons the size of a pizza…

4
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:30,950
…and still wonder if it worked?

5
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:40,950
Do your numbers end in “…”?

6
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:50,950
Is the tab you need always the eleventh?

7
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,150
You are not alone.

8
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:59,950
Up to 100% of GALIL employees have experienced AppSheet.

9
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:05,950
Introducing: Employee Portal. Four apps, one sign-in.

10
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,950
Take once a day. With coffee.

11
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:18,950
Everything in one place.

12
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:25,950
Report your day in a minute.

13
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:32,950
Every budget, live. No “…”.

14
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:39,950
Approve in one click.

15
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:46,950
Speaks Hebrew. Fluently.

16
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:52,350
I used to spend my evenings in AppSheet.Now I just spend my evenings. — A project manager*

17
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:56,950
*Dramatization. Evenings may vary.

18
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:02,350
I asked one question.I got one answer. — A CEO*

19
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:06,950
*A real CEO. Same day.

20
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:10,550
Side effects may include:

21
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:13,750
Month end in one afternoon

22
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:16,950
Invoices that match the hours

23
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,150
Fewer “quick questions”

24
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:24,550
Free evenings

25
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:27,350
A suspiciously relaxed Inon

26
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:30,950
If relaxation lasts more than four hours, consult Tamir.

27
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:34,550
Employee Portal is not for everyone.

28
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:39,950
It is especially not for people who enjoy clicking.

29
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:45,150
Ask your CEO if Employee Portal is right for you.

30
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:55,950
Retire AppSheet — approved.

31
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:05,950
Employee Portal. Less clicking. More writing. A Danny Gelman production. Side effects are real.
